<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Your monthly usage has been refreshed - Fintrack</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto,
          'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f5;
        color: #3f3f46;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .wrapper {
        background-color: #f4f4f5;
        padding: 40px 20px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 440px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      }

      .header {
        padding: 40px 40px 28px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      }

      .brand-name {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #18181b;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin: 0;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 32px 40px 40px 40px;
      }

      .greeting {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #18181b;
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      }

      .text {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #71717a;
        margin: 0 0 24px 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .detail-box {
        background-color: #fafafa;
        border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 0 0 24px 0;
      }

      .detail-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      }

      .detail-row:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
        padding-bottom: 0;
      }

      .detail-row:first-child {
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      .detail-label {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #a1a1aa;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .detail-value {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #18181b;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .upgrade-box {
        background-color: #fafafa;
        border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 0 0 24px 0;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .upgrade-text {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #71717a;
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      }

      .btn {
        display: block;
        background-color: #7c7aff;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .btn-secondary {
        display: block;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        color: #3f3f46 !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 13px 32px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-align: center;
        border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
        background-color: #fafafa;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #a1a1aa;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #7c7aff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='wrapper'>
      <div class='container'>
        <div class='header'>
          <table
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            border='0'
            style='display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 20px;'
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style='background-color: #7c7aff; border-radius: 10px; width: 40px; height: 40px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0;'
              >
                <img
                  src='cid:fintrack-logo'
                  width='22'
                  height='22'
                  alt=''
                  style='display:block; margin: 9px auto;'
                />
              </td>
              <td style='padding-left: 10px; vertical-align: middle;'>
                <span
                  style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #18181b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.02em; white-space: nowrap;"
                >FinTrack</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <h1 class='brand-name'>Fintrack</h1>
        </div>

        <div class='content'>
          <p class='greeting'>Fresh start, {{firstName}}.</p>
          <p class='text'>Your free monthly usage has been refreshed. Your AI
            insights, chat, and receipt upload allowances are ready to use again
            through {{periodEnd}}.</p>

          <div class='detail-box'>
            <div class='detail-row'>
              <span class='detail-label'>Valid from: &nbsp;</span>
              <span class='detail-value'>{{periodStart}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class='detail-row'>
              <span class='detail-label'>Valid until: &nbsp;</span>
              <span class='detail-value'>{{periodEnd}}</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a href='https://fintrack.live/dashboard' class='btn'>Go to Dashboard</a>

          <div class='upgrade-box'>
            <p class='upgrade-text'>Need more? Upgrade to PRO for unlimited AI
              insights, higher chat limits, and more receipt uploads every
              month.</p>
            <a href='https://fintrack.live/dashboard/upgrade' class='btn-secondary'>Explore PRO</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='footer'>
          <p>Questions? Reach us at
            <a href='https://www.fintrack.live/support'>Support</a></p>
          <p>&copy; 2026 Fintrack Inc. &bull;
            <a href='https://fintrack.live'>fintrack.live</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
